`<div style="position: relative; width: 816px; height: 1056px; overflow: hidden; background: #dde3e3"><img src="assets/era/_shared/paper-grain.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 816px; height: 1056px; display: block; opacity: 0.30"><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 816px; height: 16px; background: #1b2841"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 20px; width: 816px; height: 2px; background: #a26f26"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 48px"><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #a26f26; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap;">Norris for Senate</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 78px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 64px; line-height: 1; color: #1b2841; text-transform: uppercase">The menu</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 160px; width: 704px; height: 3px; background: #1b2841"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 186px; width: 334px"><div style="position: relative; display: inline-block; border: 3px solid #1b2841; padding: 9px 46px 7px 16px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1; color: #1b2841; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; white-space: nowrap">Late supper<div style="position: absolute; right: 15px; top: 50%; width: 12px; height: 12px; margin-top: -6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #a26f26"></div></div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; color: #4d5866; margin-top: 10px">In the ballroom foyer from 11 P.M.</div><div style="margin-top: 12px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #1b2841"><span>Steak frites</span><span style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #a26f26">32.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.36; color: #1b2841; margin-top: 4px">Seared sirloin, shallot and red wine butter, double-fried potatoes.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #1b2841"><span>Lobster linguine</span><span style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #a26f26">36.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.36; color: #1b2841; margin-top: 4px">Split tails, garlic, chilli, cherry tomatoes and white wine.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #1b2841"><span>Chairman&rsquo;s cake</span><span style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #a26f26">11.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.36; color: #1b2841; margin-top: 4px">Dark chocolate, baked to order, set at the edges, soft in the centre.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #1b2841"><span>Coffee or tea</span><span style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #a26f26">7.05</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.36; color: #1b2841; margin-top: 4px">Poured at the table. Mind your shirt.</div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 426px; top: 186px; width: 334px"><div style="position: relative; display: inline-block; border: 3px solid #1b2841; padding: 9px 46px 7px 16px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1; color: #1b2841; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.01em; white-space: nowrap">The bar<div style="position: absolute; right: 15px; top: 50%; width: 12px; height: 12px; margin-top: -6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #a26f26"></div></div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 17px; color: #4d5866; margin-top: 10px">Cash bar. Drink tickets welcome.</div><div style="margin-top: 12px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #1b2841"><span>French 75</span><span style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #a26f26">14.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.36; color: #1b2841; margin-top: 4px">Gin, lemon and sugar, shaken, topped with brut champagne.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #1b2841"><span>Champagne</span><span style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #a26f26">16.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.36; color: #1b2841; margin-top: 4px">Brut, by the glass.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #1b2841"><span>Wine by the glass</span><span style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #a26f26">11.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.36; color: #1b2841; margin-top: 4px">House red or white.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #1b2841"><span>Beer</span><span style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #a26f26">8.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.36; color: #1b2841; margin-top: 4px">Domestic or imported.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.12; color: #1b2841"><span>Soft drinks</span><span style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; color: #a26f26">4.00</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.36; color: #1b2841; margin-top: 4px">Cola, ginger ale, club soda.</div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 704px; width: 704px; height: 1px; background: #1b2841; opacity: 0.5"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 728px; width: 340px; height: 190px; outline: 2px solid #a26f26; outline-offset: 5px"><img src="assets/era/unplanned/still-podium-d64f57.webp" alt="The Congressman at the podium in front of the flag" style="display: block; width: 340px; height: 190px"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 928px; width: 340px; font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 16px; color: #4d5866">Congressman David Norris of Brooklyn.</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 430px; top: 724px; width: 330px"><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #a26f26; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1; white-space: nowrap;">From the campaign</div><div style="font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.42; color: #1b2841; margin-top: 9px">Whatever the count says, thank you. Eat something, the returns run late. Hats to the cloakroom, and no photographs at the bar. The bus back to Brooklyn leaves the side doors at 1 A.M.</div><div style="font-family: 'Mrs Saint Delafield', cursive; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1; color: #1b2841; margin-top: 2px">Charlie Traynor</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 610px; top: 40px; width: 150px; height: 92px; background: #e9c86a; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(20,25,35,0.3); transform: rotate(-6deg)"><div style="position: absolute; left: 6px; top: 6px; width: 134px; height: 76px; border: 1.5px solid #1b2841"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 14px; width: 150px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: #1b2841">HAT CHECK</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 34px; width: 150px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 34px; line-height: 1; color: #8e2a2a">No. 47</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 68px; width: 150px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1b2841">Hats and umbrellas</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 428px; top: 62px; width: 190px; height: 80px; background: #f3f4ef; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(20,25,35,0.3); transform: rotate(5deg)"><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 34px; height: 80px; background: #1b2841"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 34px; top: 0; width: 0; height: 80px; border-left: 2px dotted #f3f4ef"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 29px; width: 34px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 15px; color: #a26f26">&#9733;</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 46px; top: 10px; font-family: 'Fraunces', serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1; color: #1b2841; white-space: nowrap">ONE DRINK</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 46px; top: 40px; font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.2; color: #1b2841">Ballroom bar<br><span style="color: #8e2a2a; font-weight: 600">No. 0705</span></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 960px; width: 704px; height: 1px; background: #1b2841; opacity: 0.5"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 967px; width: 704px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-family: 'Spectral', serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.3; color: #4d5866"><span>A private wedding is also with us tonight. Kindly keep to the ballroom.<br>Service doors are for staff only. The Hotel Carrow.</span><span style="text-align: right">Prices subject to change.<br>Banquet order 1107, 2006</span></div><img src="assets/era/unplanned/wear-back-5e8dee.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 816px; height: 1056px; display: block"></div>`
