`<div style="position: relative; width: 672px; height: 1344px; overflow: hidden; background: #f4e2dc"><img src="assets/era/_shared/paper-grain.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 672px; height: 1344px; display: block; opacity: 0.30"><div style="position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 18px; width: 636px; height: 1308px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 6px solid #173f3c"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 28px; top: 28px; width: 616px; height: 1288px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1.5px solid #b31f2c"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 54px; width: 560px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1;">West 57th Street, New York</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 66px; width: 560px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive; font-size: 76px; line-height: 1.45; color: #b31f2c">The Tea Room</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 184px; width: 560px; text-align: center"><div style="font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #b31f2c; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1;">Christmas all year round</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 214px; width: 560px; height: 9px; border-top: 3px solid #173f3c; border-bottom: 1px solid #b31f2c"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 52px; top: 252px; border: 2px solid #b31f2c; padding: 5px; background: #fdf6f1; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(40,20,20,0.18)"><img src="assets/era/dorothysupper/photo-samovar-1927-352663.webp" alt="A brass samovar on a white cloth, photographed in 1927" style="display: block; width: 248px; height: 380px"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 52px; top: 676px; border: 2px solid #b31f2c; padding: 5px; background: #fdf6f1; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(40,20,20,0.18)"><img src="assets/era/dorothysupper/spot-samovar-room-f03ece.webp" alt="Dorothy Michaels at a banquette, the room's brass samovar behind her" style="display: block; width: 248px; height: 420px"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 336px; top: 250px; width: 280px"><div style="font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #b31f2c; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1;">To begin, at the table</div><div style="margin-top: 6px"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px"><div style="font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b31f2c; white-space: nowrap">Zakuski</div><div style="flex: 1; height: 9px; border-top: 3px solid #173f3c; border-bottom: 1px solid #b31f2c; margin-top: 8px"></div></div></div><div style="margin-top: 6px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.15; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Finger sandwiches</span><span style="color: #b31f2c">5.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.38; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 3px">Egg salad with watercress, and cucumber with cream cheese, on soft white bread. Crusts off, cut in triangles.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.15; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Red pepper dip</span><span style="color: #b31f2c">4.25</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.38; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 3px">Charred under the grill, peeled, whipped smooth with feta, yoghurt, garlic, hot chilli flakes and olive oil. Sesame crackers.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.15; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Blini, red caviar</span><span style="color: #b31f2c">9.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.38; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 3px">Hot buckwheat pancakes, salmon roe, sour cream and melted butter.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 26px; background: #fdf6f1; border: 1.5px solid #173f3c; padding: 14px 16px 6px"><div style="font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #b31f2c; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1;">Our guest book</div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.42; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 8px">The tea is strong, the room is warm, and the regulars know my name.</div><div style="font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b31f2c; text-align: right">Dorothy Michaels</div></div><div style="margin-top: 22px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase">Lunch from noon<br>Dinner from five<br><span style="color: #b31f2c">Supper until one</span></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 362px; top: 1172px; width: 230px; height: 124px; background: #fdf6f1; box-shadow: 0 2px 7px rgba(40,20,20,0.32); transform: rotate(-4deg); text-align: center"><div style="position: absolute; left: 7px; top: 7px; width: 216px; height: 110px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1.5px solid #b31f2c"></div><div style="margin-top: 18px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: #b31f2c; line-height: 1">RESERVED</div><div style="margin-top: 4px; font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.3; color: #173f3c">Mr. Fields</div><div style="font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: #173f3c; line-height: 1">ONE O&rsquo;CLOCK, FOR TWO</div></div><img src="assets/era/dorothysupper/wear-front-2e20bf.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 672px; height: 1344px; display: block"></div>`,
`<div style="position: relative; width: 672px; height: 1344px; overflow: hidden; background: #f4e2dc"><img src="assets/era/_shared/paper-grain.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 672px; height: 1344px; display: block; opacity: 0.30"><div style="position: absolute; left: 18px; top: 18px; width: 636px; height: 1308px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 6px solid #173f3c"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 28px; top: 28px; width: 616px; height: 1288px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1.5px solid #b31f2c"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 54px"><div style="font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1;">Dinner from five, supper until one</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 54px; top: 62px; font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive; font-size: 60px; line-height: 1.45; color: #b31f2c">The Menu</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 164px; width: 560px; height: 9px; border-top: 3px solid #173f3c; border-bottom: 1px solid #b31f2c"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 494px; top: 40px; width: 104px; height: 150px; background: #b31f2c; box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(40,20,20,0.32); transform: rotate(6deg); text-align: center; color: #fdf6f1"><div style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: -5px; width: 104px; height: 10px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, #f4e2dc 0 5px, transparent 5px 10px)"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 44px; top: 16px; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: #f4e2dc"></div><div style="margin-top: 42px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.2em; line-height: 1">COAT CHECK</div><div style="font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 58px; line-height: 1.1">40</div><div style="font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; line-height: 1">THE TEA ROOM</div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 180px; width: 560px"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px"><div style="font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive; font-size: 42px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b31f2c; white-space: nowrap">From the kitchen</div><div style="flex: 1; height: 9px; border-top: 3px solid #173f3c; border-bottom: 1px solid #b31f2c; margin-top: 8px"></div></div><div style="margin-top: 4px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.15; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Roast chicken</span><span style="color: #b31f2c">19.82</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.38; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 3px">Butter, grated lemon peel and thyme under the skin. Carved, with potatoes browned in the drippings.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.15; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Chicken Kiev</span><span style="color: #b31f2c">16.75</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.38; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 3px">Rolled around herb butter, breaded and fried golden. Careful with the first cut.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.15; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Beef Stroganoff</span><span style="color: #b31f2c">17.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.38; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 3px">Tenderloin strips, mushrooms and sour cream over buttered noodles.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 18px"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px"><div style="font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive; font-size: 42px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b31f2c; white-space: nowrap">Sweets</div><div style="flex: 1; height: 9px; border-top: 3px solid #173f3c; border-bottom: 1px solid #b31f2c; margin-top: 8px"></div></div></div><div style="margin-top: 4px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.15; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Strawberry shortcake</span><span style="color: #b31f2c">4.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.38; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 3px">Cream biscuits baked this morning, split and filled with sugared berries and soft whipped cream.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.15; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Blintzes</span><span style="color: #b31f2c">5.25</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.38; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 3px">Thin crepes around sweet farmer cheese, browned in butter, with sour cream.</div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 846px; width: 300px"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px"><div style="font-family: 'Pacifico', cursive; font-size: 38px; line-height: 1.5; color: #b31f2c; white-space: nowrap">From the samovar</div><div style="flex: 1; height: 9px; border-top: 3px solid #173f3c; border-bottom: 1px solid #b31f2c; margin-top: 8px"></div></div><div style="margin-top: 4px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.15; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Russian tea</span><span style="color: #b31f2c">2.40</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.38; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 3px">Strong and black, poured into glasses. Lemon and cherry preserves on the side, to stir in.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.15; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Iced vodka</span><span style="color: #b31f2c">3.75</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.38; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 3px">Poured from a frosted carafe.</div></div><div style="margin-top: 16px"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 14px; font-family: 'Oswald', sans-serif; font-weight: 600; font-size: 27px; line-height: 1.15; color: #173f3c; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.02em"><span>Coffee</span><span style="color: #b31f2c">1.50</span></div><div style="font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.38; color: #173f3c; margin-top: 3px">With cream, refilled all day.</div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 380px; top: 868px; width: 236px; border: 2px solid #b31f2c; padding: 4px; background: #fdf6f1; box-sizing: content-box; margin-left: -6px"><img src="assets/era/dorothysupper/spot-lunch-80af84.webp" alt="A regular and her agent at the front banquette" style="display: block; width: 236px; height: 200px"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 374px; top: 1086px; width: 248px; font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-style: italic; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.35; color: #4f6360">Agents lunch here, and so do their clients.</div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 1232px; width: 560px; height: 1px; background: #173f3c; opacity: 0.5"></div><div style="position: absolute; left: 56px; top: 1240px; width: 560px; font-family: 'Lora', serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.45; color: #4f6360"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between"><span>West 57th St., N.Y. 10019. PLaza 7-1982.</span><span>Form 4-82</span></div><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between"><span>Sandwich trays sent up to the TV studios.</span><span>Prices subject to change.</span></div></div><img src="assets/era/dorothysupper/wear-back-9085cd.webp" alt="" aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; width: 672px; height: 1344px; display: block"></div>`
